      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Drug treatment of cerebrovascular disorders alone and in combination with UV irradiation of autoblood gave rise to a positive trend in clinical and functional parameters more noticeable in the combined treatment. Also, there was a fall in red cell levels of malonic dialdehyde. A course of speleotherapy given to children with bronchial asthma contributed to normalization of free radical oxidation and reestablishment of molecular structure in red cell membranes."},
